# 38. USER MANAGEMENT WORKFLOW

A typical workflow for creating a test user could be:

### Step 1 - Create User

```bash
sudo useradd -m john
```

### Step 2 - Set Password

```bash
sudo passwd john
```

### Step 3 - Check User

```bash
id john
```

### Step 4 - Create Group

```bash
sudo groupadd developers
```

### Step 5 - Add User to Group

```bash
sudo usermod -aG developers john
```

### Step 6 - Verify Group

```bash
groups john
```

### Step 7 - Switch to User

```bash
su - john
```

### Step 8 - Check Current User

```bash
whoami
```

### Step 9 - Return to Previous User

```bash
exit
```

